<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Methodology | GearPilot AI</title></head><body><header><a href="/">GearPilot AI — Home</a></header><main><h1>How we rank products</h1><p>We first filter products by the selected market, known landed price, required dimensions, and product features. We then calculate a weighted score using price, mechanical capability, warranty, usability, features, and evidence confidence.</p><p>For value rankings, weights are 30%, 20%, 20%, 15%, 10%, and 5% respectively. Affiliate commissions never influence scores. Scores are not equivalent to hands-on testing.</p><p>Current examples are fictional and for software demonstration only. Before listing real products we will verify merchant permissions, evidence, price freshness and product claims.</p></main></body></html>
